    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "tiny things dont help. i've tried the small changes. it doesn't matter if i go for a walk or listen to music, the walls are still there. it's not a routine i can just deviate from, it's the whole architecture of my existence. i made this cage so i wouldn't get hurt, but now the cage is the only thing i have left and it's killing me. there's no way out of this that doesn't require tearing everything down.",
