      "content": "there is no \"small piece.\" the cage is... it's everything. it's my mind, my history, the way i see the world. you can't just dismantle a part of it and expect to be free. the only way to actually break out of this is to destroy the thing that's trapped. i feel like i'm just waiting for the courage to finally let the whole thing collapse.",
